<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sternŭo</span></b> , ŭi,
		3, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [cf. Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτάρνυσθαι</span>, v. <i><span class="en">Curt. Griech. Etym. p. 696</span></i>].
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to sneeze</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adorare aliquem, cum sternuerit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 40, 40, § 107</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">28, 6, 15,
				§ 57</span></i>; <i><span class="en">19, 3, 15, § 40</span></i> (al. sternuto); <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 5,
				18</span></i> Schneid. <i>N.
			cr.</i>—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of a light, <i>to
				sputter</i>, <i>crackle</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sternuit et lumen ... sternuit, et nobis
					prospera signa dedit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 19, 151 sq.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to sneeze out</i>, <i>give by sneezing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 3, 24</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">approbationem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					45, 9</span></i>
			 and 18.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
